# Keep the seed-server build context small and, more importantly, keep local
# credentials, images, generated artifacts, and lab state out of image layers.
#
# Pattern semantics (Docker / moby patternmatcher): a pattern WITHOUT a
# leading `**/` is anchored at the context root -- `*.key` excludes only
# `./x.key`, never `server/certs/x.key`. server/Dockerfile COPYs whole trees
# (`COPY server/`, `COPY device/`, `COPY lab/`), so every secret-shaped
# pattern below is written `**/...` to reach nested files. Last match wins,
# and `!` re-includes a single file after a broader exclusion.
# server/tests/test_dockerignore.py evaluates this file against a planted
# tree and fails if any of the names below leak back in.
.git/
.cache/
.pytest_cache/
.opencode/
.superpowers/
AGENTS.md
**/__pycache__/
**/*.pyc
**/.DS_Store

creds/
artifacts/
bin/
# ...except the handed-in aria2c client, which server/Dockerfile COPYs in.
# It is produced by the aria2-next-static project and installed by
# tools/get-aria2c.sh; it is gitignored but must reach the build context.
!bin/aria2c
images/
deliverables/
agentinfo/
fleet/*.csv
fleet/*.conf
fleet/dist/
lab/evidence/

# Credentials and key material, wherever they sit in the tree.
**/.env
**/*.env
**/*.pem
**/*.key
**/*.crt
**/*.p12
**/rpc-secret
**/tokens.txt
**/id_rsa*
# ...except the pinned Cisco Bulk Hash verify cert: public material (no
# private key), tracked in git, read by server/bulkhash.py at runtime.
!server/certs/cisco_bulkhash_verify.pem

# Device images, torrents, download state, built device packages.
**/*.bin
**/*.pkg
**/*.torrent
**/*.aria2
**/*.rpm
**/*.tgz
**/*.tar

# Host-specific Compose override (lab ports/mounts) and the Cisco-licensed
# console typeface -- redistribution is not permitted, so it must never be
# distributed inside an image or the release tarball (see .gitignore). A
# deployment that independently holds the Sharp Sans license restores it at
# RUNTIME instead, via the IRIS_SHARP_SANS_FONT_HOST bind mount in
# server/docker-compose.yml -- never by re-adding it here.
server/docker-compose.override.yml
server/webroot/fonts/SharpSans-Bold.woff2

deploy/
site/
release/
device/iox/out/
device/xr/out/
HANDOFF*.md

# Tests and generated documentation are not needed by either runtime role.
server/tests/
device/tests/
device/agent/tests/
device/iox/tests/
device/xr/tests/
lab/tests/
docs/
